            "g": 0.9019607843137255,
            "b": 0.5411764705882353,
            "a": 0.8
          },
          "text": "Optimize the fill color scale with a custom domain to limit the effect of outliers in the data. Set a custom range using a Vega syntax {\"scheme\": \"blues\", \"count\": 7}, or copy a scale from https://observablehq.com/@d3/color-schemes. ",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontColor": {
            "r": 0.15294117647058825,
            "g": 0.15294117647058825,
            "b": 0.16470588235294117,
            "a": 1
